                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">52,722</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Total for Oahu</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">60,748</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Total for Kauai</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">4,636</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Grand total</cell>
                        <cell/>
                        <cell role="num">412,829</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>The annual rents of the estate at the present time amount to about $50,000, and
                    are increasing.</p>
                <p>E. and O. E.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. D. Alexander</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Survey or-General</hi>.</signed></closer>
